{"id": "1801629", "name": "נגזרת – פונקציה בחזקת פונקציה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3393509_DERIV_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">נגזרת – פונקציה בחזקת פונקציה</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>מצאו את הנגזרת של הפונקציה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 2;\">\\(\\displaystyle f'\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 8px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>בדיקת ההקלדה</strong><br>[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3393509_DERIV_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>נשתמש בגזירה לוגריתמית. נסמן \\(\\displaystyle y=g\\left(x\\right)^{h\\left(x\\right)}\\)</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ln\\left(y\\right)=h\\left(x\\right)\\ln\\left(g\\left(x\\right)\\right)\\)</div>\n<p>נגזור את שני האגפים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{y\\'}{y}=h\\'\\ln\\left(g\\right)+h\\frac{g\\'}{g}\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle y\\'=g^h\\left(h\\'\\ln\\left(g\\right)+h\\frac{g\\'}{g}\\right)={{CT:1}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 42, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-CALCULUS]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varss:listofvars(ans1);\nan1:ans1;\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varss) do an1:ev(an1,varss[i]=v);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "an1", "tans": "deriv", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "an1", "tans": "alsoDeriv", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "alsoDeriv", "b", "deriv", "f", "f1", "g", "g1", "g2", "g3", "g4", "gi", "h", "h1", "h2", "h3", "h4", "hi", "m", "v"], "nvariants": 50}